# Files in this folder that should NOT be published as part of the website.
# Same idea as .gitignore. Cloudflare reads this when it uploads the site.
#
# src/ is the Worker's code. It is compiled into the Worker itself, so it does
# not also need to sit on the web as a downloadable file.
#
# index.html is NOT listed here on purpose. It is the hand-written page as it
# stood on 10 September, and it stays published as the fallback: if
# run_worker_first in wrangler.jsonc is ever removed or stops working, "/"
# serves that file instead of nothing. The Worker redirects /index.html to /
# so nobody reaches the stale copy by accident while things are working.

**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
src
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
package-lock.json
.gitignore
.assetsignore
